{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Type the documented nullish factory result.** The runtime and documentation allow `createPlugin` to return `null` or `undefined` to skip an invocation, but this public signature rejects both, forcing consumers and the new test to cast. Widen it to `Plugin | null | undefined`, update the local variable in `createInvocationPluginRunner` accordingly, and remove the unsafe test cast.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74ronS","finding_digest":"eb3e65a619b347307dcd311f42a1758ebdc3b479ddf84b19d5f54d1d83920cdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_5m7gljqzwndta7ongepufilvr2","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/types/plugin.ts::durableinstrumentationpluginfactory-createplugin::nullish-return-contract","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/types/plugin.ts::durableinstrumentationpluginfactory-createplugin::nullish-return-contract","line":323,"observation_digest":"8b792b554a5462c37d33a74b5287da31d6d3f7a3bbe2632ec8f59c2cdb03d7bf","observation_id":"aro_v1_rn4swvkkkrrmg7jtu5fvfb62gh","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/types/plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5m7gljqzwndta7ongepufilvr2","published_at":"2026-10-03T07:39:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6ynwkqdujlvqu5halh2xihcnr7","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"03610bf92d562c6788e983e087b93d89bf1ce56d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":323,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_lzxhjpbpuno3a7zgb5gcxenxww","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T07:39:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
